lass=\"p-card-cta\">View specifications →</span> </a>", "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>링크 볼·L볼</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다.<br>제조사·형번 체계가 서로 다른 <strong>링크 볼</strong>과 <strong>L볼</strong>을 용도가 같아 한 곳에 모았습니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>Link Balls · L-Balls</h2> <p>A spherical joint combining a ball stud with a socket-type seat, used at the connections of linkage mechanisms where linear and oscillating motion occur together.<br>We have gathered <strong>Link Balls</strong> and <strong>L-Balls</strong>, which use different manufacturer and model numbering systems, in one place because they serve the same purpose.</p>", "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>링크 볼·L볼</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트입니다.<br>제조사·형번 체계가 서로 다른 <strong>링크 볼</strong>과 <strong>L볼</strong>을 용도가 같아 한 곳에 모았습니다.</p> <p class=\"tpl-use\"><strong>용도</strong> · 직선 · 요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · L-Ball</p> <h2>Link Balls · L-Balls</h2> <p>A spherical joint combining a ball stud with a socket-type seat.<br>We have gathered <strong>Link Balls</strong> and <strong>L-Balls</strong>, which use different manufacturer and model numbering systems, in one place because they serve the same purpose.</p> <p class=\"tpl-use\"><strong>Applications</strong> · Connections of linkage mechanisms where linear and oscillating motion occur together</p>", "<a class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\" href=\"notice_thread_direction.html\">우나사·좌나사 안내 보기 →</a>": "<a class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\" href=\"notice_thread_direction.html\">View right-hand / left-hand thread guide &rarr;</a>"}, "ja": {"링크 볼": "リンクボール", "<a class=\"product-card\" href=\"link_ball_zbl.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"18\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"27\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-li